@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Reified statement governed by a doxastic predicate (KGRC-like pattern after transformation).
:S { :A rdfs:subClassOf :B . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:st1 a rdf:Statement ; rdf:subject :x ; rdf:predicate rdf:type ; rdf:object :A .
:eve :believes :st1 . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
